<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-026" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:nickname" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:nickname:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBA">虎㹠</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:nickname:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBA">王彭之</persName>小字也。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:family:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBA">彭之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:family:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBA">安壽</persName>，琅邪人。祖<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:family:m0011" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABD">正</persName>，尚書郎。父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:family:m0018" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">彬</persName>，衛將軍。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:family:m0024" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBA">彭之</persName>仕至黃門郎。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">虎犢</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">彪之</persName>小字也。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother:m0009" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">彪之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother:m0012" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">叔虎</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBA">彭之</persName>第三弟。年二十而頭鬚皓白，時人謂之<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wangpeng:brother:m0034" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">王白鬚</persName>。</p>
</text>
